sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Admin Client
    participant FeedbackGW as Feedback Gateway
    participant FeedbackCtrl as Feedback Controller
    participant SessionRepo as Session Repository
    participant RubricSvc as Rubric Service
    participant RubricRepo as Rubric Repository
    participant FeedbackSvc as Feedback Service
    participant TurnRepo as Turn Repository
    participant MessageRepo as Message Repository
    participant ScoringSvc as Scoring Service
    participant LLMSvc as LLM Service
    participant ScoreRepo as Score Repository
    participant CoachingSvc as Coaching Service
    participant BenchmarkSvc as Benchmark Service
    participant BenchmarkRepo as Benchmark Repository
    participant EventBus as Event Bus

    Admin->>FeedbackGW: POST /feedback/score<br/>{sessionId, rubricId?}
    FeedbackGW->>FeedbackCtrl: Forward request

    FeedbackCtrl->>SessionRepo: Validate session ended
    alt Session not ended
        SessionRepo-->>FeedbackCtrl: Not complete
        FeedbackCtrl-->>Admin: 409 Session Not Complete
    end
    SessionRepo-->>FeedbackCtrl: Session valid

    alt rubricId provided
        FeedbackCtrl->>RubricSvc: Retrieve rubric
        RubricSvc->>RubricRepo: Get Rubric & Criterion records
        alt Rubric not found
            RubricRepo-->>RubricSvc: Not found
            RubricSvc-->>FeedbackCtrl: 404 Rubric Not Found
            FeedbackCtrl-->>Admin: 404 Error
        end
        RubricRepo-->>RubricSvc: Rubric & criteria
    else No rubricId
        FeedbackCtrl->>RubricSvc: Get default rubric for org
        RubricSvc->>RubricRepo: Retrieve default
        RubricRepo-->>RubricSvc: Default rubric
    end
    RubricSvc-->>FeedbackCtrl: Rubric ready

    FeedbackCtrl->>FeedbackSvc: Generate scorecard
    FeedbackSvc->>TurnRepo: Retrieve all turns
    FeedbackSvc->>MessageRepo: Retrieve all messages
    TurnRepo-->>FeedbackSvc: Turn history
    MessageRepo-->>FeedbackSvc: Message history

    loop For each Criterion
        FeedbackSvc->>ScoringSvc: Evaluate session

        alt LLM-based scoring
            ScoringSvc->>LLMSvc: Generate score with reasoning
            Note over LLMSvc: Analyze conversation<br/>Score 0-maxPoints
            LLMSvc-->>ScoringSvc: Score + reasoning
        else Rule-based scoring
            Note over ScoringSvc: Pattern matching<br/>Keyword detection
        end

        ScoringSvc->>ScoreRepo: Create ScoreItem<br/>{criterionId, score, maxPoints, details}
    end

    Note over FeedbackSvc: Calculate totalScore<br/>(weighted sum)
    FeedbackSvc->>ScoreRepo: Create Scorecard<br/>{sessionId, rubricId, totalScore, maxScore}
    ScoreRepo-->>FeedbackSvc: Scorecard created {scorecardId}

    FeedbackSvc->>CoachingSvc: Generate coaching tips
    Note over CoachingSvc: Analyze low-scoring areas
    CoachingSvc->>LLMSvc: Create coaching text
    LLMSvc-->>CoachingSvc: Tips with excerpts

    CoachingSvc->>ScoreRepo: Create CoachTip records<br/>{text, excerptRef, link}

    FeedbackSvc->>BenchmarkSvc: Update team/org averages
    BenchmarkSvc->>BenchmarkRepo: Update benchmarks

    FeedbackSvc->>EventBus: Emit feedback.ready<br/>{scorecardId, sessionId}

    FeedbackSvc-->>FeedbackCtrl: Scorecard complete
    FeedbackCtrl-->>Admin: 200 OK<br/>{scorecardId, summary}